const d=load("closure_decisions");
const comment=`Execution complete.

- 111/111 approved target issues received a specific rationale comment linking this log.
- 111/111 approved target issues are closed.
- 0 approved targets remain open.
- 171 retained work or blocked-work issues remain open.
